#
#  Minimal-ish FVWM3 config (Doric Beach / Plan 9-ish tool stack)
#  Layout: left "tool stack" (NOT a full bar)
#    - xclock (top-left)
#    - xload  (under clock)
#    - PagerDock (under xload)
#    - IconManDock (window list under pager)
#
