#######
# 5: Mouse and Key bindings
####################

Silent Key F1   A M Menu MenuFvwmRoot
Silent Key Menu A A Menu MenuFvwmRoot

# Window list (Super+Tab and Alt+Tab)
#Silent Key Tab A 4 WindowList Root 0 0 \
#    NoIcons, NoDeskSort, SelectOnRelease Meta_L, CurrentAtEnd
Silent Key Tab A M WindowList Root c c \
    NoIcons, NoGeometry, NoDeskSort, SelectOnRelease Meta_L, CurrentAtEnd, TruncateLabel 76
Silent Key Tab A 4 WindowList Root c c \
    NoIcons, NoGeometry, NoDeskSort, SelectOnRelease Meta_L, CurrentAtEnd, TruncateLabel 76

# Cycle windows (Super + o)
Silent Key o A 4 Next (CurrentPage, AcceptsFocus) Focus

# Desktop navigation (Super + number)
Silent Key 1 A 4 GotoDesk 0 0
Silent Key 2 A 4 GotoDesk 0 1
Silent Key 3 A 4 GotoDesk 0 2
Silent Key 4 A 4 GotoDesk 0 3
Silent Key 5 A 4 GotoDesk 0 4

# Move window to desktop (Super + Shift + number)
Silent Key 1 A 4S MoveToDesk 0 0
Silent Key 2 A 4S MoveToDesk 0 1
Silent Key 3 A 4S MoveToDesk 0 2
Silent Key 4 A 4S MoveToDesk 0 3
Silent Key 5 A 4S MoveToDesk 0 4

# Maximize / management
Silent Key space A 4S Maximize 100 100
Silent Key q     A 4  Close
Silent Key f     A 4S Maximize
Silent Key r     A 4S Raise
Silent Key m     A 4S Lower

# Page cycling (Super + n/p) — linear order: (0,0)->(0,1)->(1,0)->(1,1)
Silent Key n A 4 Exec exec sh -c 'idx=$(( $[FVWM_PAGE_X] * 2 + $[FVWM_PAGE_Y] )); idx=$(( (idx + 1) % 4 )); FvwmCommand "GotoPage $(( idx / 2 )) $(( idx % 2 ))"'
Silent Key p A 4 Exec exec sh -c 'idx=$(( $[FVWM_PAGE_X] * 2 + $[FVWM_PAGE_Y] )); idx=$(( (idx + 3) % 4 )); FvwmCommand "GotoPage $(( idx / 2 )) $(( idx % 2 ))"'

# Page navigation (Super + Ctrl + number)
Silent Key 1 A 4C GotoPage 0 0
Silent Key 2 A 4C GotoPage 0 1
Silent Key 3 A 4C GotoPage 1 0
Silent Key 4 A 4C GotoPage 1 1

# Move window between pages (Super + Shift + Ctrl + number)
Silent Key 1 A 4CS MoveToPage 0 0
Silent Key 2 A 4CS MoveToPage 0 1
Silent Key 3 A 4CS MoveToPage 1 0
Silent Key 4 A 4CS MoveToPage 1 1

# Emacs-style window movement by 25% (Super + Alt + f/b/n/p)
Silent Key f WTSF 4M AnimatedMove w+25p keep
Silent Key b WTSF 4M AnimatedMove w-25p keep
Silent Key n WTSF 4M AnimatedMove keep w+25p
Silent Key p WTSF 4M AnimatedMove keep w-25p

# Emacs-style window resizing by 25% (Super + Ctrl + Alt + f/b/n/p)
Silent Key f WTSF 4CM Resize w+25p keep
Silent Key b WTSF 4CM Resize w-25p keep
Silent Key n WTSF 4CM Resize keep w+25p
Silent Key p WTSF 4CM Resize keep w-25p

Silent Key Return A 4 Exec exec $[infostore.terminal]
Test (x $[infostore.runcmd]) Silent Key Space A 4 Exec exec $[infostore.runcmd] $[infostore.runcmdopt]

Silent Key backslash A 4 ToggleLeftPanel

Silent Key w A 4  WindowList Root c c NoIcons, AllDesks, TruncateLabel 76
Silent Key k A 4  Exec exec kbd
Silent Key e A 4  Exec exec emacsclient -c -a emacs > /dev/null
Silent Key b A 4S Exec exec battery -n
Silent Key l A 4S Exec exec xsecurelock

Silent Key XF86MonBrightnessDown A A Exec exec backlight --decrease
Silent Key XF86MonBrightnessUp   A A Exec exec backlight --increase

# Window Buttons
Mouse 1 1 A Menu MenuWindowOps Delete
Mouse 1 2 A Close
Mouse 1 2 A Destroy

# Super + Mouse bindings - move and resize anywhere in window
Mouse 1 W 4 Move
Mouse 3 W 4 Resize

Mouse 1 T    A RaiseMoveX Move Maximize
Mouse 1 FS   A RaiseMove Resize
Mouse 4 T    A WindowShade True
Mouse 5 T    A WindowShade False
Mouse 1 R    A Menu MenuFvwmRoot
Mouse 2 R    A WindowList
Mouse 3 R    A Menu MenuWindowOpsLong
Mouse 1 I    A RaiseMoveX Move "Iconify off"
Mouse 3 T    A Menu MenuWindowOps
Mouse 3 I    A Menu MenuIconOps

DestroyFunc HideLeftPanel
AddToFunc   HideLeftPanel
+ I KillModule FvwmButtons LeftPanel
+ I KillModule FvwmIconMan IconManDock
+ I KillModule FvwmPager PagerDock
# + I Exec exec pkill -9 xload
# + I Exec exec pkill -9 xclock
+ I EwmhBaseStruts 0 0 0 0
DestroyFunc ShowLeftPanel
AddToFunc   ShowLeftPanel
+ I Module FvwmButtons LeftPanel
+ I EwmhBaseStruts 151 0 0 0
#EwmhBaseStruts 172 15 26 15

DestroyFunc ToggleLeftPanel
AddToFunc   ToggleLeftPanel
+ I All (LeftPanel) HideLeftPanel
+ I TestRc (NoMatch) ShowLeftPanel

DestroyFunc ShuffleDir
AddToFunc   ShuffleDir
+ I Move shuffle layers $[w.layer] $[w.layer] snap windows $0
+ I WarpToWindow 50 50

Key Up      WTSF    CM  ShuffleDir up
Key Down    WTSF    CM  ShuffleDir down
Key Left    WTSF    CM  ShuffleDir left
Key Right   WTSF    CM  ShuffleDir right
Key Up      WTSF    CSM Maximize True 0 growup
Key Down    WTSF    CSM Maximize True 0 growdown
Key Right   WTSF    CSM Maximize True growright 0
Key Left    WTSF    CSM Maximize True growleft 0


